{"version":1,"key":"card:462","content":{"id":462,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"放在函数开头的字符串称为文档字符串（docstring），将作为函数的一部分存储起来。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"def square(x):\n    'Calculates the square of the number x.'\n    return x * x","language":"py","uuid":"f13e2088-8df1-437a-8df6-2dda011e9d8c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"__doc__","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 访问文档字符串："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> square.__doc__\n'Calculates the square of the number x.'","language":"py","uuid":"78def6b6-0518-4402-abb8-95db74fff1bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在交互式解释器中，可使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"help","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 获取有关函数的信息，其中包含函数的文档字符串。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> help(square)\nHelp on function square in module __main__:\n\n\nsquare(x)\nCalculates the square of the number x.","language":"py","uuid":"3030796e-f06a-485d-a849-b3f2782a4db2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Python/函数"],"createTime":1719225421564,"updateTime":1759491277273,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1759491277273}}